{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43516","headline":"夏夜李尚书筵送宇文石首赴县联句 · 杜甫","name":"夏夜李尚书筵送宇文石首赴县联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爱客尚书贵，之官宅相贤。\n酒香倾坐侧，帆影驻江边。\n翟表郎官瑞，凫看令宰仙。\n雨稀云叶断，夜久烛花偏。\n数语敧纱帽，高文掷彩笺。\n兴饶行处乐，离惜醉中眠。\n单父长多暇，河阳实少年。\n客居逢自出，爲别几凄然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43516.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43516","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}